Third-party font licence for font_aa.py
=======================================

klippy/extras/display/font_aa.py contains anti-aliased glyph bitmaps used by the
ili9488 graphical UI. They are rendered by scripts/gen_aa_fonts.py from the DejaVu
TrueType fonts (DejaVuSans.ttf and DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf). DejaVu is a derivative of
the Bitstream Vera fonts: the Bitstream Vera portions are licensed under the terms
below, and the DejaVu changes are released into the public domain.

This notice is reproduced to satisfy the Bitstream Vera licence requirement that
"the above copyright and trademark notices and this permission notice shall be
included in all copies". The rendered bitmaps are not named "Bitstream" or "Vera",
so the licence's naming restriction is not engaged. The fonts are distributed only
as part of this larger software package, never sold by themselves.

Font source: https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/

